OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain this evening and
OL,7,Finto the night, turning heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes, especially over parts of the
OL,9,FSouthwest. Becoming drier later in the
OL,10,Fnight with a few clear intervals.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,13,Fa few showers, these showers more
OL,14,Ffrequent over Dumfries and Galloway,
OL,15,Fwith the best of the sunshine towards
OL,16,FBerwickshire and East Lothian.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
